WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,960
You call this getting into trouble

2
00:00:02,890 --> 00:00:04,210
Isn’t this coming back alive?

3
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:07,120
Let’s do it like this next time

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,160
I'll hide your gun

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,760
Okay, just listen to your wife

6
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,020
What's going on here?

7
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:22,630
it's all gold

8
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:24,830
The little devil stole it from us back then.

9
00:00:25,430 --> 00:00:27,900
Now it’s the original owner’s turn

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:34,610
Thirty gold bars are just left outside

11
00:00:35,010 --> 00:00:37,430
Behind that iron door

12
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,000
How many things are hidden?
